{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object seen, approach it. If close, take it. If taken, process it. Then, move to destination or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    />",
    "BT": {
